      'kind' => 'spur',
      'price' => 219,
      'keyword' => 'buckingham climbing spikes',
      'title' => 'Buckingham Climbing Spikes: Steel Climbers, Lower Straps',
      'h1' => 'Buckingham Climbing Spikes: Steel Climbers with Lower Straps',
      'meta' => 'Buckingham climbing spikes in steel with lower straps: a no-frills base set you can build out with the pads you prefer. Typical price, fit notes and care tips.',
      'tagline' => 'Basic steel Buckingham climbers with lower straps, ready for the pads you choose.',
      'summary' => 'These Buckingham climbing spikes are steel climbers with lower straps, a base set for climbers who want to choose their own upper pads. It is a practical starting point for Buckingham climbing gear without paying for pads you might replace.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
