      'tagline' => 'An 11.8mm low-stretch Marlow climbing line in blue and orange.',
      'summary' => 'Marlow Vesper climbing rope is an 11.8mm arborist line built for low stretch and a durable cover, here in a blue and orange colorway. It is a popular choice for single rope ascents and for climbers who want one line that also handles doubled-rope work.',
      'highlights' => 
