      'title' => 'Yale New Moon 11.7mm Climbing Rope: Buyer\'s Guide',
      'h1' => 'Yale New Moon 11.7mm Climbing Rope',
      'meta' => 'Yale New Moon climbing rope in 11.7mm: a 24-strand arborist line for hitch and SRS climbing. How it compares to Blue Moon, setup tips and inspection basics.',
      'tagline' => 'An 11.7mm 24-strand Yale climbing line for hitch and device climbing.',
      'summary' => 'Yale New Moon climbing rope is an 11.7mm 24-strand arborist line from the same family as the popular Blue Moon. It suits climbers who want a familiar Yale feel in a line that runs both friction hitches and SRS devices.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => '11.7mm 24-strand construction',
        1 => 'Same family feel as Yale Blue Moon',
        2 => 'Works with matched hitches and many SRS devices',
        3 => 'Distinct color from Blue Moon for easy sorting',
        4 => 'Takes a spliced eye',
