          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'Feet are one of the parts of the body most often hit by a saw, especially when bucking on the ground or limbing a felled tree. Chainsaw boots carry protective layers designed to slow and clog a moving chain, giving you a better chance than a plain work boot. Check the boot\'s label for its cut-protection standard and class.',
            1 => 'The Protector Prime pairs that protection with a supportive upper and a lugged sole that holds in mud, leaves and on slopes. The high, stiff ankle also works well with climbing spurs on removals.',
            2 => 'Chainsaw boots are an investment, so take care of them and they will last. Keep a second pair of socks in the truck for wet days, and replace worn laces before they break on a climb.',
          ),
        ),
        1 => 
        array (
          'h' => 'Fit and care',
          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'Try boots on with the socks you work in and allow some break-in time. A good fit matters on long days hauling brush and running a chipper.',
            1 => 'Clean off mud and sap, let them dry naturally away from heaters, and treat the leather regularly. Retire boots that take a chain cut, because protective fibers do not recover. Chainsaw boots supplement, never replace, chaps and safe saw handling. Compare more <a href="/clothing/arborist-boots/">arborist boots</a>.',
          ),
        ),
      ),
      'faq' => 
      array (
        0 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'Are Haix Protector Prime boots chainsaw protective?',
          'a' => 'Yes. They are chainsaw boots with cut-protective inserts. Check the label for the exact standard and class.',
        ),
        1 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'Can I wear them with climbing spurs?',
          'a' => 'Many climbers do, as the stiff upper and ankle support suit spur work. Check spur fit with your boot size.',
        ),
      ),
      'use' => 
      array (
        0 => 'felling',
        1 => 'ground',
        2 => 'apparel',
      ),
      'level' => 'pro',
      'brand_path' => NULL,
      'photo' => 
      array (
        'src' => '/assets/photos/boot-0.webp',
        'sm' => '/assets/photos/boot-0-sm.webp',
        'title' => 'Old Boot, New Boot',
        'creator' => 'General Wesc',
        'creator_url' => 'https://www.flickr.com/photos/35518575@N00',
