      'title' => 'ISC Aluminum Oval Carabiner, Triple-Locking Gate',
      'h1' => 'ISC Aluminum Oval Carabiner, Triple-Locking',
      'meta' => 'ISC aluminum oval carabiner with a triple-locking gate: a symmetrical connector that keeps pulleys and devices centered in hitch climbing and rigging setups.',
      'tagline' => 'A symmetrical aluminum oval with a triple-action gate for pulleys and devices.',
      'summary' => 'The ISC aluminum oval carabiner is a connector with a triple-locking gate and a symmetrical shape. It keeps pulleys, swivels and devices sitting in the center of the basket, which is why ovals are a staple of hitch climbing systems.',
      'highlights' => 
