            1 => 'Outside of climbing, crews use handled ascenders to grab a line for hauling or for progress capture in a simple pull system. See other ascenders in <a href="/climbing/climbing-gear/ascent-and-descent/">ascent and descent</a>.',
            2 => 'Choose the hand that suits your climbing. Many climbers use a right-hand ascender on the upper position and keep their left hand for tending the system or a second device.',
