      'keyword' => 'dmm ultra o',
      'title' => 'DMM Ultra O Durolock Oval Carabiner',
      'h1' => 'DMM Ultra O Durolock Carabiner',
      'meta' => 'The DMM Ultra O Durolock is a large auto-locking oval carabiner for pulleys, rope grabs, and multi-piece setups. Where it fits, checks, and typical price.',
      'tagline' => 'Large auto-locking oval carabiner for pulleys and multi-piece setups.',
      'summary' => 'The DMM Ultra O is a large oval carabiner, and this version has the Durolock auto-locking gate. Arborists use the Ultra O where they need room for several pieces of hardware and want them to sit centered.',
