      'h1' => 'DMM Ultra O Locksafe Carabiner',
      'meta' => 'The DMM Ultra O Locksafe is a large oval carabiner with a three-stage auto-locking gate, good for pulleys and stacked hardware. Uses, checks, typical price.',
      'tagline' => 'Large oval carabiner with DMM\'s three-stage Locksafe gate.',
      'summary' => 'The DMM Ultra O Locksafe pairs a roomy oval body with DMM\'s Locksafe three-stage auto-locking gate. It holds pulleys, rope grabs, and rings centered and resists being opened by accident.',
      'highlights' => 
