          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'Some connections get crowded: an anchor with a sling and a rope eye, a bridge with a device and a lanyard, or a rigging point with a block and a sling. The Pirate\'s large pear shape gives those pieces room to sit side by side instead of piling up against the gate.',
            1 => 'Rock Exotica builds the Pirate with a smooth nose that is less likely to hang up on a sling or bark when you clip and unclip. The bigger size does add some weight, so most climbers carry one or two for the crowded spots rather than using it for everything.',
