      'h1' => 'Rock Exotica rockD Carabiner, Black',
      'meta' => 'The black Rock Exotica rockD is an auto-locking D-shaped carabiner for lanyards, friction savers, and saddle connections. Why color helps, checks, and price.',
      'tagline' => 'Black auto-locking D carabiner for everyday climbing connections.',
      'summary' => 'The Rock Exotica rockD in black is an auto-locking D-shaped carabiner for arborist climbing. The D shape keeps loads near the spine, and the black finish makes it easy to tell apart from the rest of your hardware.',
