        array (
          'h' => 'Organizing the saddle',
          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'Gear loops fill up fast with carabiners, slings, a throw bag, and spare hitch cord. A few dedicated clips let you group items by job, so the rigging bits are in one place and the climbing spares are in another. That makes it quicker to find what you need without looking down.',
