            1 => 'Check them now and then like any other hardware: a gate that no longer closes, a bent hook, or a cracked body means it goes in the bin. A dropped saw or handsaw can injure the ground crew, so make sure whatever hangs from the clip is secured the way the maker intends. Browse more <a href="/climbing/climbing-gear/carabiners-and-hardware/saddle-storage/">saddle storage</a>.',
