      'keyword' => 'samson ice tail',
      'title' => 'Samson Ice Tail Hand-Spliced Eye-to-Eye Hitch Cord',
      'h1' => 'Samson Ice Tail Hand-Spliced Eye-to-Eye',
      'meta' => 'Samson Ice Tail is a hand-spliced eye-to-eye hitch cord for moving-rope climbing, with spliced eyes that keep the hitch tidy and a cover built to handle heat.',
      'tagline' => 'Hand-spliced hitch cord from Samson made for friction hitches on climbing lines.',
      'summary' => 'Samson Ice Tail hand-spliced eye-to-eye is a friction hitch cord with a spliced eye on each end, ready for a Distel, VT or similar hitch on your climbing line. Spliced eyes are slim and flexible, so the hitch sits neatly and tends well with a rope runner or micro pulley.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => 'Hand-spliced eye on each end',
        1 => 'Made for friction hitches on climbing lines',
        2 => 'Slim, flexible eyes keep the hitch tidy',
        3 => 'Built to handle the heat of descents',
        4 => 'Made by Samson Rope',
      ),
