      'tagline' => 'Middle-size 9mm Epicord hitch cord with sewn eyes for balanced grip and release.',
      'summary' => 'The Teufelberger 9mm Epicord prusik is a sewn eye-to-eye hitch cord that sits between the grippy 8 mm and the smoother 10 mm. Epicord is one of Teufelberger\'s best-known hitch cords, and the 9 mm size is a common choice for climbers on mid-size climbing lines.',
