      'h1' => 'Yale 8mm Beeline Eye-to-Eye Sewn Prusik',
      'meta' => 'The Yale 8mm Beeline sewn prusik is a slim, heat-resistant hitch cord with sewn eyes that grips firmly on smaller ropes and holds up to hot descents.',
      'tagline' => 'Slim, heat-resistant Beeline hitch cord with sewn eyes for smaller ropes.',
      'summary' => 'The Yale 8mm Beeline eye-to-eye sewn prusik is a slim friction hitch cord with a sewn eye on each end. It combines the firm bite of an 8 mm cord with Beeline\'s heat-resistant construction, which makes it a common pick for climbers on smaller-diameter lines.',
