      'meta' => 'The Beeline foot lock prusik from Yale Cordage is a hitch cord sized for secured footlocking, with a heat-resistant cover and dependable grip on the line.',
      'tagline' => 'A Beeline prusik sized for secured footlocking on a single or doubled line.',
      'summary' => 'The Yale Beeline foot lock prusik is a length of Beeline hitch cord with terminated ends, sized to tie a prusik for secured footlocking. You advance it up the rope as you climb and it holds you if you slip or stop to rest.',
      'highlights' => 
