      'h1' => 'Husqvarna Climbing Harness',
      'meta' => 'Husqvarna climbing harness for arborists who want a supportive saddle for pruning and removals. Read fit advice and inspection tips before you climb in one.',
      'tagline' => 'An arborist climbing saddle from Husqvarna\'s tree care range.',
      'summary' => 'The Husqvarna climbing harness is an arborist saddle from Husqvarna\'s tree care gear line, made for work positioning while pruning and removing trees. It suits climbers who already run Husqvarna saws and want a saddle from the same range.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => 'Arborist saddle from Husqvarna',
        1 => 'Bridge attachment for climbing systems',
        2 => 'Side D-rings for a lanyard',
        3 => 'Gear loops for saws and tools',
        4 => 'Check sizing before buying',
