      'meta' => 'Weaver Super Climber pads add extra padding and wrap to your tree spurs for better comfort on removals. See fit tips, compatibility, and the typical price.',
      'tagline' => 'Padded wrap pads that add comfort over basic L-pads.',
      'summary' => 'Weaver Super Climber pads are padded wrap pads that cushion the calf and help hold your tree spurs in line. They are a step up in comfort from basic L-pads.',
