      'keyword' => 'klein climbers with big buck pads',
      'title' => 'Klein Climbers with Big Buck Pads for Tree Work',
      'h1' => 'Klein Climbers with Big Buck Pads',
      'meta' => 'Klein climbers with Big Buck pads combine durable steel tree spurs with large, supportive pads for removal work. See fit tips, gaff care, and the typical price.',
      'tagline' => 'Steel Klein Tools climbers set up for tree work with Big Buck pads.',
      'summary' => 'Klein Climbers with Big Buck Pads pair Klein Tools steel climbers with Big Buck pads. Klein is a long-standing name in climbing hardware, and steel shanks hold up well to daily removal work.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
