      'kind' => 'parts',
      'price' => 40,
      'keyword' => 'climb right height adjustment sleeve',
      'title' => 'Climb Right Height Adjustment Sleeve and Screws',
      'h1' => 'Climb Right Height Adjustment Sleeve and Screws (Steel)',
      'meta' => 'Climb Right height adjustment sleeve with screws for steel climbers. Replace a worn sleeve and get the spur shank height dialed in for your leg again.',
      'tagline' => 'Replacement height sleeve and hardware for adjustable Climb Right steel climbers.',
      'summary' => 'This Climb Right height adjustment sleeve comes with its screws and replaces the height-adjusting section on Climb Right steel climbers. Swap it when holes wear, hardware strips or the shank won\'t hold its setting.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => 'Sleeve and screws in one kit',
        1 => 'For adjustable Climb Right steel climbers',
        2 => 'Restores correct shank height',
        3 => 'Keeps your spurs in service',
      ),
      'specs' => 
