          'a' => 'They are made for Tree Hog aluminum climbers. Don\'t fit them to other brands unless the maker confirms compatibility.',
        ),
        1 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'Can I sharpen these with a grinder?',
          'a' => 'No. Use a file to avoid overheating the steel and changing the profile.',
