      'h1' => 'Buckingham Velcro Lower Straps',
      'meta' => 'Buckingham Velcro lower straps for climbing spurs: quick on and off, even tension at the ankle and a fresh, snug fit for worn or stretched climber straps.',
      'tagline' => 'Replacement Velcro lower straps for a quick, even fit on your climbing spurs.',
