      'h1' => 'Wesco Highliner Boots, 10" Brown',
      'meta' => 'Wesco Highliner boots in brown with a 10 inch height: handmade lineman and climbing boots with a heavy shank for spurs. Fit, break-in and care notes.',
      'tagline' => 'Handmade 10 inch lineman-style boots built to stand on spurs all day.',
      'summary' => 'Wesco Highliner boots are handmade lineman-style boots with a stiff shank and heel built for standing on spurs and pegs. This 10 inch brown version is a long-lasting choice for climbers who spike a lot.',
      'highlights' => 
