          'q' => 'Are the wayUP Light pants chainsaw protective?',
          'a' => 'No. Wear chaps or chainsaw pants when running a saw on the ground.',
        ),
        1 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'Are lightweight climbing pants durable enough for ground work?',
          'a' => 'They hold up to normal climbing, but heavy canvas lasts longer if you spend most days dragging brush.',
        ),
