      'keyword' => 'silky hayate 390mm',
      'title' => 'Silky Hayate 390mm XL Teeth Replacement Blade',
      'h1' => 'Silky Hayate 390mm XL Teeth Replacement Blade (Blade Only)',
      'meta' => 'A Silky Hayate 390mm replacement blade with extra-large teeth for the Hayate telescoping pole saw. Fast cuts in big green limbs. Fit, swap and care notes.',
      'tagline' => 'A 390 mm extra-large-tooth blade for the Silky Hayate telescoping pole saw.',
      'summary' => 'This Silky Hayate 390mm replacement blade has extra-large teeth and is sold as a blade only. It fits the Hayate telescoping pole saw and is built to move quickly through larger green limbs from the ground.',
