      'h1' => 'Jameson 13" Ergonomic Handle Hand Saw',
      'meta' => 'The Jameson 13 inch ergonomic handle hand saw is a full-size pruning saw that stays comfortable through a long day of cuts. Who it suits, care and safety.',
      'tagline' => 'A full-size 13-inch pruning saw with a shaped grip for long days.',
      'summary' => 'This Jameson 13" ergonomic handle hand saw has a shaped grip that is easier on your hand through a long day of pruning. The 13-inch blade reaches through most limbs a climber cuts by hand.',
