        array (
          'h' => 'A classic grip',
          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'Wood handles have a following among climbers for good reasons: they stay warm in cold weather, they do not feel tacky in heat, and they wear in to your hand. This Jameson saw pairs that grip with a 13-inch blade, the size many climbers settle on for everyday pruning.',
            1 => 'If you want a shaped grip instead, Jameson makes an ergonomic-handle version. Compare both, plus Silky and Fanno saws, in our <a href="/cutting-and-pruning/hand-saws-and-scabbards/">hand saws and scabbards</a>.',
