            1 => 'The T540 XP Mark III is a pro top-handle aimed at climbers doing removals and heavier pruning. Keep the muffler bolts tight and the spark arrestor screen clean, and pair a muffler swap with a fresh air filter and spark plug if the saw has not been serviced recently.',
            2 => 'Westcoast Saw is known for parts and upgrades aimed at arborist top-handle saws. If your T540 XP Mark III is due for other service, doing it all at once keeps the saw out of the tree for one day instead of several.',
