          'a' => 'It suits general removal rigging and mid-size wood. Check the manufacturer\'s strength rating and size up when pieces get heavier or you expect dynamic loads.',
        ),
        1 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'How do I tell when rigging rope is worn out?',
          'a' => 'Look for cuts, glazing, flat or stiff sections, exposed core, and fuzzing that goes deep into the braid. When in doubt, retire it.',
        ),
      ),
