      'price' => 140,
      'keyword' => 'dead-eye ring sling',
      'title' => '3/4 in. x 15 ft Dead-Eye Ring Sling for Rigging',
      'h1' => '3/4 in. Dead-Eye Ring Sling, 15 ft',
      'meta' => 'A 3/4 inch by 15 ft dead-eye ring sling with a rigging ring for heavy removal work. Long enough for big stems, with a smooth ring for friction rigging points.',
      'tagline' => 'A long 3/4 inch dead-eye sling with a ring for big-stem rigging points.',
      'summary' => 'This 3/4 inch dead-eye ring sling is 15 ft long with a ring on it, giving you a heavy rigging point that wraps big stems. Run your line through the ring or clip a block to it, and choke the sling through its eye on the stem.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => '3/4 inch rope',
        1 => '15 ft long for large stems',
        2 => 'Ring for friction or block attachment',
        3 => 'Spliced dead eye for a quick choke',
