      'keyword' => 'dead-eye ring sling',
      'title' => 'Dead-Eye Ring Sling with Beast Ring',
      'h1' => 'Dead-Eye Ring Sling with Beast Ring',
      'meta' => 'A dead-eye ring sling fitted with a large Beast ring, giving a smooth, high-capacity rigging point for heavy removals and friction rigging in big trees.',
      'tagline' => 'A dead-eye sling with a large Beast ring for heavy friction rigging.',
      'summary' => 'This dead-eye ring sling comes with a Beast ring, a large rigging ring, for a smooth, heavy-duty rigging point. Choke the sling on the stem through its eye and run the rigging line through the ring or clip a block.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => 'Dead-eye sling with a large ring',
        1 => 'Smooth, wide rope path',
        2 => 'Heavy-duty friction rigging',
        3 => 'Lighter than a big steel block',
