      'h1' => 'Yale Buzz Line Climbing Rope',
      'meta' => 'Yale Buzz Line is a 12-strand arborist climbing rope from Yale Cordage. Learn how it handles with friction hitches, length tips, and the typical US price.',
      'tagline' => 'A Yale Cordage 12-strand climbing rope for everyday tree work.',
      'summary' => 'Yale Buzz Line is a 12-strand climbing rope from Yale Cordage for arborists who want a simple, spliceable line for everyday tree work. It suits climbers who prefer traditional hitch climbing on a doubled rope.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => '12-strand braid construction',
        1 => 'Easy to inspect along its length',
        2 => 'Works with friction hitches and many devices',
        3 => 'Bright color stands out in the canopy',
        4 => 'Sold in common arborist lengths',
