          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'An 11mm rope is lighter to carry and to pull up for a long SRS ascent, and it feeds quickly through hardware. The trade-off is that some devices and hitches grip a smaller rope differently, so you may need a different hitch cord or device setting than you use on 1/2 in rope.',
