          'h' => 'Compatibility, inspection and care',
          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'Before you buy, check the diameter range of your hitch cord, ascenders and descent device, since compatibility is set by those makers. You can compare it with the other <a href="/rope/climbing-rope/24-strand-climbing-rope/">24-strand climbing ropes</a> we carry.',
            1 => 'Climbing rope is life-support equipment. It must meet the applicable standard, ANSI Z133 and the manufacturer\'s instructions. Inspect it before every climb for cuts, glazing, sheath damage and soft or stiff spots, keep it away from saws, fuel and bar oil, and retire it when in doubt. Get trained before you climb.',
