      'price' => 289,
      'keyword' => 'courant squir climbing rope',
      'title' => 'Courant Squir Climbing Rope, Red, 11mm: Specs & Buying Guide',
      'h1' => 'Courant Squir Climbing Rope, Red, 11mm',
      'meta' => 'Courant Squir Climbing Rope, Red, 11mm for SRS climbing and access lines. What it is, how it handles, sizing and care, plus the typical price.',
