      array (
        0 => 
        array (
          'h' => 'Where clear lenses fit',
          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'Clear lenses are the everyday choice for shade, canopy work, overcast days, and early starts. Pick the lens for the light you work in; tinted lenses in deep shade make it hard to see cuts, and clear lenses in full sun cause squinting.',
            1 => 'Because they cost so little, it is easy to stock a box in the truck so nobody has an excuse to work without them. Compare other <a href="/safety/eye-protection/">eye protection</a> if you need a different fit.',
