          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'The Optime range comes in three levels. The yellow muffs are the lightest and have the lowest attenuation, which suits moderate noise. For a chipper or stump grinder you will usually want a higher model like the Optime 105.',
            1 => 'That makes the yellow Optime a good choice for groundies doing cleanup, running a blower or working around but not right next to a saw. Check the noise reduction rating on the product against your exposure.',
