      'h1' => 'Yale Phantom 11mm Climbing Rope (Green and Purple)',
      'meta' => 'Yale Phantom 11mm climbing rope in green and purple, a static climbing line for SRS and moving rope work. How it handles, device fit, and inspection.',
      'tagline' => 'An 11mm static climbing line for arborists running SRS devices or hitches.',
      'summary' => 'Yale Phantom 11mm climbing rope is an arborist line, shown here in green and purple. Its low-stretch construction suits stationary-rope ascents and gives mechanical devices a consistent line to work on.',
      'highlights' => 
