      'meta' => 'A Husqvarna file handle for round chainsaw files. Gives a solid grip, steadier strokes, and a safer sharpening job on the tailgate. Fit and use tips here.',
      'tagline' => 'A simple grip for round chainsaw files, for steadier and safer sharpening.',
