      'meta' => 'The Weaver throw line storage bag in medium keeps your throw line flaked, clean, and ready to throw. How it fits into setting a climbing line, and packing tips.',
      'tagline' => 'A medium Weaver bag that keeps throw line clean and ready to throw.',
      'summary' => 'The Weaver throw line storage bag in medium gives your throw line a dedicated home, so it flakes out cleanly instead of turning into a snarl in the truck. It is sized for a typical throw line with room to stuff it quickly between throws.',
