      'keyword' => 'weaver nesting throwline storage bag',
      'title' => 'Weaver Nesting Throwline Storage Bag for Two Lines',
      'h1' => 'Weaver Nesting Throwline Storage Bag',
      'meta' => 'The Weaver nesting throwline storage bag nests one bag inside another, so you carry two or more throw lines in a compact kit. How it works and when to use it.',
      'tagline' => 'Nesting Weaver throw line bags that stack together to save room in the kit.',
      'summary' => 'The Weaver nesting throwline storage bag is designed so bags fit inside one another, letting you carry a spare throw line or a second color without adding bulk. Each line stays in its own bag, so they do not tangle together.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => 'Bags nest together to save space',
        1 => 'Keeps each throw line separate',
        2 => 'Line pays out cleanly',
        3 => 'Handy for spare or second line',
        4 => 'Tough Weaver construction',
      ),
