      'h1' => 'Jameson Tri-Cut Saw Blade with Hook (13")',
      'meta' => 'The Jameson tri-cut saw blade with hook is a 13 inch replacement for a dull pole saw blade. What the hook does, how tri-cut teeth cut, and fitting and care.',
      'tagline' => 'A 13 inch tri-cut pole saw blade with a hook for clearing hangers.',
      'summary' => 'The Jameson tri-cut saw blade is a 13 inch replacement pole saw blade with tri-cut teeth and a hook at the tip. The teeth cut fast on the pull stroke, and the hook helps you pull down hangers and clear small limbs without switching tools.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
