      'kind' => 'rope',
      'price' => 249,
      'keyword' => 'courant komora climbing rope',
      'title' => 'Courant Komora Climbing Rope: 16-Strand Line Guide',
      'h1' => 'Courant Komora Climbing Rope',
      'meta' => 'The Courant Komora climbing rope is a 16-strand arborist line for tree climbers on MRS and SRS. See how it handles, what to pair it with and how to inspect it.',
      'tagline' => 'A 16-strand arborist climbing line from Courant for everyday tree work.',
      'summary' => 'The Courant Komora climbing rope is a 16-strand arborist line made for tree climbing, with a firm cover that runs well through friction hitches and mechanical devices. It suits climbers who want a dependable everyday line from a European maker that builds only climbing and work rope.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => '16-strand arborist climbing line',
        1 => 'Made by Courant in Europe',
        2 => 'Firm cover for hitches and devices',
        3 => 'For MRS and, where approved, SRS',
        4 => 'Sold in hanks, check length at checkout',
      ),
      'specs' => 
