            1 => 'The green Pine Beauty color is easy to tell apart from the rest of the gear on the truck, which helps on crews running several lines. Check your device maker\'s compatibility list before running it on SRS.',
            2 => 'ArborFreak has a following among climbers who switch between MRS and SRS, since one line can cover both if your devices approve it. New rope often runs a little stiff for the first climbs, so give it time to break in before judging how it pairs with your hitch.',
          ),
        ),
        1 => 
