      'keyword' => 'yale bee line 10mm',
      'title' => 'Yale Bee Line 10mm Hitch Cord by the Foot',
      'h1' => 'Yale Bee Line 10mm Hitch Cord (By the Foot)',
      'meta' => 'Yale Bee Line 10mm hitch cord by the foot is a heat-tolerant friction hitch cord for tree climbers on larger ropes. How to size it, finish it and care for it.',
      'tagline' => '10mm Bee Line hitch cord from Yale, cut to the length you need.',
      'summary' => 'Yale Bee Line 10mm hitch cord is built to handle the heat a friction hitch makes on descent, and it is sold by the foot so you can cut your own hitch. The thicker diameter suits climbers on larger lines who want smooth tending.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
