      'tagline' => 'Sport-style ERB safety sunglasses for crews working in bright sun.',
      'summary' => 'The ERB O.N.E. Ammo safety glasses are sport-style safety sunglasses that give tree workers glare control and eye protection in one light pair. They suit ground work, climbing and chipper duty on sunny days.',
      'highlights' => 
      array (
        0 => 'Sport-style safety sunglasses',
