          'h' => 'Why choose a plastic mesh visor',
          'p' => 
          array (
            0 => 'Plastic mesh is light and does not dent or rust the way some metal screens can. It breathes well, so it stays clear on hot days and when you are working hard in the tree.',
            1 => 'It is a good fit for climbers who want face protection that weighs almost nothing and stays out of the way when flipped up.',
