            0 => 'Check that your helmet is a 2019 or later Vertex or Strato, since older shells use a different mount. Click the shield in on both sides and check it pivots and holds position.',
            1 => 'Rinse sap and dust off with water and mild soap, let it dry, and replace it once it is bent, torn or hard to see through. A visor adds protection from chips and debris but does not replace safety glasses, so wear both. More options are in our <a href="/safety/eye-protection/">eye protection</a> range.',
          ),
        ),
      ),
      'faq' => 
      array (
        0 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'Does the 2019 Vizir fit older Vertex helmets?',
          'a' => 'No. It is for the 2019 and later Vertex and Strato. Check your helmet version first.',
        ),
        1 => 
        array (
          'q' => 'Can the Vizir fog up?',
          'a' => 'Clear shields can fog in humid or cold weather. A mesh shield breathes better if fog is a problem.',
        ),
      ),
      'use' => 
