      'meta' => 'ART (Arbor Rope Technologies) climbing gear, including the SpiderJack friction device, Positioner 2 swivel lanyard adjuster and Ropeguide friction saver.',
      'intro' => 'ART, short for Arbor Rope Technologies, makes engineered climbing hardware for arborists. The ART SpiderJack is its best-known piece, alongside the Positioner lanyard adjuster and the Ropeguide friction saver.',
      'about' => 
      array (
        0 => 'ART designs gear for climbers who like mechanical solutions. The SpiderJack is a mechanical friction device that takes the place of a friction hitch on a moving rope system, giving consistent, adjustable friction and smooth tending. The Positioner, including the Positioner 2 with swivel, is a lanyard adjuster designed for work positioning.',
        1 => 'ART also makes the Ropeguide, a friction saver that protects both the tree and your line at the tie-in point. This kind of hardware rewards climbers who read the instructions closely and practice low and slow before using it at height. Learn it with a qualified trainer, follow ART\'s instructions for compatible ropes and connectors, and inspect it before every climb.',
