      'title' => 'Arb Climber Tree Climbing Gear',
      'meta' => 'Arb Climber gear for tree climbers. Read what to look for in climbing equipment and how to inspect it before it goes up the tree on your next job.',
      'intro' => 'Arb Climber is a brand name tree climbers may see on climbing gear. Like any climbing equipment, Arb Climber products should be matched to your system and checked before each climb.',
      'about' => 
      array (
        0 => 'Climbing gear lives a hard life: sap, grit, sun and constant loading. Whatever brand you run, the basics are the same. Know what each piece is rated for, keep it clean, and pull it from service when it shows wear you cannot explain.',
        1 => 'If you are adding Arb Climber gear to your kit, read the product\'s instructions and confirm it works with your rope, hitch and connectors. Any gear that holds a person must meet the applicable standard (ANSI Z133 and the manufacturer\'s instructions), be inspected before each use, and be used by trained climbers.',
