    '/aspen-fuel/' => 
    array (
      'slug' => 'aspen-fuel',
      'path' => '/aspen-fuel/',
      'name' => 'Aspen',
      'keyword' => 'aspen 2 stroke fuel',
      'title' => 'Aspen Alkylate 2-Stroke Fuel for Chainsaws',
      'meta' => 'Aspen alkylate 2-stroke fuel for chainsaws and handheld power gear. Premixed, low in harmful compounds and ready to pour, so you skip mixing on the truck.',
      'intro' => 'Aspen makes alkylate petrol, and Aspen 2 stroke fuel is the premixed version a lot of saw users keep for their chainsaws, pole saws and blowers. It comes ready to use, so there is no mixing on the tailgate.',
      'about' => 
      array (
        0 => 'Alkylate fuel is a cleaner-burning petrol with far fewer of the aromatic compounds found in regular pump gas. For anyone running a saw all day, that means less of the exhaust you breathe while you buck and limb. Aspen 2 is premixed with two-stroke oil, while Aspen 4 is the version for four-stroke equipment.',
        1 => 'Many operators also like alkylate for storage. It does not contain ethanol, so it holds up better in saws that sit between jobs and in seasonal equipment. Check your saw manufacturer\'s guidance on fuel and mix ratio, and when you switch fuels, let the saw run and confirm it is tuned properly before putting it back to work.',
