        1 => 'Keep records of when gear went into service, store it out of the sun and away from fuel and chemicals, and retire it after a fall or when inspection turns up damage. Any gear that holds a person must meet the applicable standard (ANSI Z133 and the manufacturer\'s instructions), be inspected before each use, and be used by trained climbers.',
